---
import {
  nearlyFreeElectronEigenvalues,
  nearlyFreeElectronGap,
} from '../../../data/part04/ch12TeachingModels.mjs';

const defaultCoupling = 0.35;
const makePath = (branch) => Array.from({ length: 181 }, (_, index) => {
  const q = -1.5 + 3 * index / 180;
  const energies = nearlyFreeElectronEigenvalues({ q, velocity: 1, coupling: defaultCoupling });
  const x = 50 + 500 * index / 180;
  const y = 130 - 62 * energies[branch];
  return `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${y.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual nfe-explorer" data-nfe-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：Bragg 面附近的两态耦合与带隙</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: two-state coupling and the gap near a Bragg plane</span>
  </figcaption>

  <label class="nfe-explorer__control">
    <span>耦合幅值 | Coupling magnitude <code>|V_G|</code></span>
    <input aria-label="Nearly free electron coupling magnitude" type="range" min="0" max="0.8" step="0.01" value={defaultCoupling} data-nfe-coupling />
    <output data-nfe-coupling-output>{defaultCoupling.toFixed(2)}</output>
  </label>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 275" role="img" aria-labelledby="nfe-title nfe-desc">
    <title id="nfe-title">Two-level nearly-free-electron avoided crossing</title>
    <desc id="nfe-desc">Upper and lower eigenvalues around a Bragg plane. Their separation at zero reduced wave vector is twice the coupling magnitude.</desc>
    <line x1="50" y1="235" x2="550" y2="235" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="50" y1="25" x2="50" y2="235" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="300" y1="25" x2="300" y2="235" class="plot-guide" />
    <line x1="50" y1="130" x2="550" y2="130" class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={makePath(0)} class="nfe-explorer__lower" data-nfe-lower />
    <path d={makePath(1)} class="nfe-explorer__upper" data-nfe-upper />
    <text x="550" y="260" text-anchor="end">q</text>
    <text x="20" y="35">E</text>
    <text x="300" y="260" text-anchor="middle">Bragg plane</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>q = 0 处的能隙 | gap at q = 0:</span>
    <strong data-nfe-gap>{nearlyFreeElectronGap(defaultCoupling).toFixed(2)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>H(q)=[[q,V_G],[V_G*,-q]]</code>，本征值 <code>E±=±sqrt(q²+|V_G|²)</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>H(q)=[[q,V_G],[V_G*,-q]]</code>, with eigenvalues <code>E±=±sqrt(q²+|V_G|²)</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>V_G=0</code> 恢复线性交叉；<code>q=0</code> 时能隙严格为 <code>2|V_G|</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> <code>V_G=0</code> restores the crossing; at <code>q=0</code> the gap is exactly <code>2|V_G|</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>模型只保留两个近简并平面波和常数耦合，不包含完整晶格、多个 Fourier 分量、电子占据或自洽势。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> only two nearly degenerate plane waves and a constant coupling are retained; the full lattice, additional Fourier components, occupations, and self-consistency are absent.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>JavaScript 已关闭：静态图对应 <code>|V_G|=0.35</code>，并保留解析验收条件。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-nfe-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-nfe-coupling]');
    const output = root.querySelector('[data-nfe-coupling-output]');
    const gap = root.querySelector('[data-nfe-gap]');
    const lower = root.querySelector('[data-nfe-lower]');
    const upper = root.querySelector('[data-nfe-upper]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(lower instanceof SVGPathElement) || !(upper instanceof SVGPathElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const coupling = Number(input.value);
      const lowerPoints = [];
      const upperPoints = [];
      for (let index = 0; index <= 180; index += 1) {
        const q = -1.5 + 3 * index / 180;
        const split = Math.hypot(q, coupling);
        const x = 50 + 500 * index / 180;
        const yLower = 130 + 62 * split;
        const yUpper = 130 - 62 * split;
        lowerPoints.push(`${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${yLower.toFixed(2)}`);
        upperPoints.push(`${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${yUpper.toFixed(2)}`);
      }
      lower.setAttribute('d', lowerPoints.join(' '));
      upper.setAttribute('d', upperPoints.join(' '));
      if (output instanceof HTMLOutputElement) output.value = coupling.toFixed(2);
      if (gap instanceof HTMLElement) gap.textContent = (2 * Math.abs(coupling)).toFixed(2);
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .nfe-explorer__control { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .nfe-explorer input, .nfe-explorer svg { width: 100%; }
  .nfe-explorer svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .nfe-explorer__lower, .nfe-explorer__upper { fill: none; stroke-width: 3; }
  .nfe-explorer__lower { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .nfe-explorer__upper { stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
</style>
